=== archive scope note ===
The archive contains GRANT statements for brewpos_app (object ACLs) but no CREATE/ALTER/DROP ROLE.
The login role is cluster-global and already existed here, so ACL replay succeeded. On a fresh cluster
without brewpos_app, those GRANTs would fail until the role is created separately.
Role/database settings are likewise cluster-global (pg_db_role_setting is not part of a database dump).
